--       (hd : 1 ≤ dP6 P n) (hl : 2 ≤ ℓP6 P n) (hW : WinOK6 P n) (hAa : 2 ≤ Aa)
--       (hcA : 2 ^ ℓP6 P n * 2 ^ ℓP6 P n ≤ Aa) (hPA : 2 * 2 ^ (ℓP6 P n * dP6 P n) ≤ Aa)
--       (hsA : 8 * (dP6 P n + ℓP6 P n) ≤ Aa) (hB : Aa ^ 6 < 2 ^ Bb) :
--       Sp jR (encK s f)
--         (encK s (update (update (update f 36 ((PP6 P n (dP6 P n) : ℤ) :: l36)) 37
--           (saL P n (dP6 P n) ++ f 37)) 38 (maL P n (dP6 P n) ++ f 38)))
--         ((dP6 P n * (cJ (2 ^ ℓP6 P n) + 1) + 1) * kU Bb)
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** Round-six setup, part 4: the source loop
--
--   `jR = rep 48 (reg 25) jB`: for `j = 0, …, d-1` (`j = d - counter`), the body computes
--   `t_j = 2^{h + [d' ≤ j]}` (`39`), `w_j = t_j / (8d²)` (`40`), `A_j = t_j - 2 w_j` (`41`), selects
--   `s_j` by the candidate loop (`42`), computes `μ_j = P^{-1} mod s_j` (`46`), pushes `s_j` on `37`
--   and `μ_j` on `38`, and multiplies the running product `P` (`36`) by `s_j`.
--
--   **`sp_jloop`**: from `P = 1` the loop leaves `P = ∏ s_j`, `37 = [s_{d-1}, …, s_0]` and
--   `38 = [μ_{d-1}, …, μ_0]` (above the old contents).
